$Aeon::Books["xSkills","cntnt"] = "<f2>Skills<f1> are the foundation of your ability to perform advanced actions. Depending on your level of '<f2>Karma<f1>' you can increase your desired Skill as long as you also possess enough <f2>Knowledge<f2> of the subject. Knowledge can be obtained at the Library, studying books on the different Skills available to you, however, some of these Books may also require a certain level of Karma themselves to be read. Unlike most of these Introductory Books, most Skill related Books require more time for your mind to fully grasp the concept, and can take much longer periods of time to learn, restricting you from checking out or reading other Books for the '<f2>Rental <f2>Period<f1>' of your last Book. Some Skills are accompanied by '<f2>Skill Funcs<f1>', which is an extra ability granted by raising the Skill level, these Skill Funcs can be then used by binding them to keys, you can learn more about this very useful process by reading <f2>'Key Binding'<f1>. Skill Funcs can normally be used to enhance their Skill's process, and also help to raise one's Karma. Once you have reached the maximum level of a Skill, you obtain '<f2>Mastery<f1>' of that Skill, so try to Master all of the skills you can without neglecting old ones!";